    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability: removing unused imports and constants, renaming cryptic variables, and clarifying misleading comments.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed unused imports (`assertNotNull`, `assertFalse`, `ParameterizedTest`, `MethodSource`) and the unused `MARK_RESET_NOT_SUPPORTED` constant, renamed cryptic `e1`/`e2` variables to `firstEofException`/`secondEofException`, and improved comments to accurately describe what each section tests."
    }
